  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-berlin-search-services",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：柏林公共服务查询服务\n\n一个提供柏林行政服务数据的模型上下文协议服务器，允许AI助手搜索和检索柏林当局提供的1000多项公共服务信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **search_services** — Search for Berlin administrative services by name or description. Returns a list of matching services with basic information.\n- **get_service_details** — Get detailed information about a specific Berlin service by its ID. Returns comprehensive information including requirements, forms, fees, appointments, and more.\n- **list_services** — List all available Berlin administrative services. Returns a paginated list of services with their names and IDs.\n- **get_services_stats** — Get statistics about the Berlin services dataset (total count, last update, etc.)"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-berlin-search-services\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-berlin-search-services\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
